patch type="fixed" "Single peer connection mode now identifies received media from the server's `mid` → track SID mapping, scanning the transceivers after each answer. Previously it relied on libwebrtc's `didAddTrack`, which fires only when a transceiver is created and never when the server binds a track to a receive section that was already negotiated — leaving that subscription pending with no error, including for every section carried across a room move"
